Local table tree-construction cases for HTML-05a. Upstream (html5lib-tests
@ 9329e646) pins the wrappers and foster parenting inside larger cases;
these pin the individual HTML-05a behaviors directly: required tbody,
colgroup, and caption wrappers, adjacent cells staying in their row,
foster-parented text and elements, and the table end-tag chain.
#data
<table><tr><td>a
#errors
#document
| <html>
|   <head>
|   <body>
|     <table>
|       <tbody>
|         <tr>
|           <td>
|             "a"

#data
<table><col>
#errors
#document
| <html>
|   <head>
|   <body>
|     <table>
|       <colgroup>
|         <col>

#data
<table><caption>c
#errors
#document
| <html>
|   <head>
|   <body>
|     <table>
|       <caption>
|         "c"

